---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import ProjectHero from "../../components/ProjectHero.astro";

const technologies = [
  "Python",
  "Pandas",
  "NumPy",
  "statsmodels",
  "Time Series",
  "Econometrics",
  "ADF",
  "GSADF",
  "SEC EDGAR",
  "Google Trends",
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Speculative Dynamics in AI Stocks | Daniela Chanta"
  description="Detection of speculative dynamics in AI-related stocks using time-series econometrics, GSADF tests, Google Trends and SEC corporate disclosures."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main>

    <!-- HERO -->

    <ProjectHero
      category="Data Science · Econometrics · Time Series"
      title="Detecting Speculative Dynamics in AI-Related Stocks"
      description="A data-driven study of speculative behavior in AI-related equities using explosive-root tests, thematic portfolios, market data and AI-hype indicators."
      year="2026"
      role="Data Scientist / Research Project"
      organization="Télécom Paris · MODS"
      technologies={technologies}
    />


    <!-- RESEARCH QUESTION -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">

        <div>
          <p
            class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
          >
            Research Question
          </p>

          <h2
            class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
          >
            Can speculative dynamics in AI-related equities be detected systematically?
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">

          <p>
            The project investigated whether the strong market performance of
            AI-related companies could be associated with periods of explosive
            price dynamics rather than only fundamental growth.
          </p>

          <p>
            The analysis combined financial market data with public measures of
            AI attention and corporate AI-related disclosures to study whether
            speculative episodes coincided with broader increases in AI hype.
          </p>

          <p>
            Instead of analyzing a single company, the project constructed
            thematic portfolios representing different segments of the AI
            ecosystem.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- DATA SOURCES -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >
      <div class="max-w-3xl">

        <p
          class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
        >
          Data
        </p>

        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
        >
          Combining market behavior with AI attention indicators.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          Several data sources were combined to capture both financial
          performance and the broader information environment surrounding AI.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7"
        >
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
            Market Data
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">
            Equity prices
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Historical market data was used to construct AI-related thematic
            portfolios and analyze their price dynamics over time.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7"
        >
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
            Public Attention
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">
            Google Trends
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Search-interest indicators were used as a proxy for changes in
            public attention toward artificial intelligence.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7"
        >
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
            Corporate Attention
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">
            SEC EDGAR
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
            AI-related references were extracted from corporate 10-K and 10-Q
            filings to measure how frequently companies discussed AI.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- METHODOLOGY -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">

        <div>
          <p
            class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
          >
            Methodology
          </p>

          <h2
            class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
          >
            Detecting periods of explosive price behavior.
          </h2>
        </div>


        <div>

          <p class="leading-8 text-slate-600">
            The analysis relied on unit-root and explosive-root testing to
            identify periods in which asset prices exhibited behavior
            inconsistent with a standard non-explosive process.
          </p>


          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-[50px_1fr]">

              <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
                01
              </p>

              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">
                  ADF testing
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
                  Augmented Dickey–Fuller tests were used as a baseline
                  time-series diagnostic.
                </p>
              </div>

            </div>


            <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-[50px_1fr]">

              <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
                02
              </p>

              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">
                  GSADF testing
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
                  Generalized Supremum ADF testing was used to test for the
                  presence of explosive dynamics, while recursive BSADF
                  statistics were used to identify and date individual episodes.
                </p>
              </div>

            </div>


            <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-[50px_1fr]">

              <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
                03
              </p>

              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">
                  Bubble dating
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
                  Recursive test statistics were compared with critical values
                  to identify the beginning and end of potential speculative
                  episodes.
                </p>
              </div>

            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- PIPELINE -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >

      <div class="max-w-3xl">

        <p
          class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
        >
          Analytical Pipeline
        </p>

        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
        >
          From raw financial data to speculative-episode detection.
        </h2>

      </div>


      <div
        class="mt-14 grid items-stretch gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr]"
      >

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">

          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
            01
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-950">
            Data Collection
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
            Market prices, search trends and SEC corporate disclosures.
          </p>

        </article>


        <div class="hidden items-center text-slate-300 lg:flex">
          →
        </div>


        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">

          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
            02
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-950">
            Portfolio Construction
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
            Companies grouped according to their role in the AI ecosystem.
          </p>

        </article>


        <div class="hidden items-center text-slate-300 lg:flex">
          →
        </div>


        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">

          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
            03
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-950">
            ADF / GSADF
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
            Econometric testing for explosive price dynamics.
          </p>

        </article>


        <div class="hidden items-center text-slate-300 lg:flex">
          →
        </div>


        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">

          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
            04
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-950">
            Interpretation
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
            Bubble episodes compared with AI attention and historical benchmarks.
          </p>

        </article>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- PORTFOLIOS -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">

        <div>
          <p
            class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
          >
            Portfolio Design
          </p>

          <h2
            class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
          >
            Segmenting the AI ecosystem.
          </h2>
        </div>


        <div>

          <p class="leading-8 text-slate-600">
            Companies were grouped into thematic portfolios to distinguish
            different parts of the AI value chain instead of treating
            AI-related equities as a single homogeneous group.
          </p>


          <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">

            <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">

              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
                Portfolio
              </p>

              <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-950">
                AI Infrastructure
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                Companies providing computing infrastructure and core
                technological capabilities supporting AI systems.
              </p>

            </article>


            <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">

              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
                Portfolio
              </p>

              <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-950">
                Cloud
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                Companies providing cloud platforms and infrastructure used to
                deploy and scale AI workloads.
              </p>

            </article>


            <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">

              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
                Portfolio
              </p>

              <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-950">
                Enterprise AI
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                Firms integrating AI into enterprise software and business
                applications.
              </p>

            </article>


            <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">

              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400">
                Portfolio
              </p>

              <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-950">
                Control Group
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
                A comparison group used to distinguish AI-specific behavior
                from broader market dynamics.
              </p>

            </article>

          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- HYPE INDICATORS -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >

      <div class="max-w-3xl">

        <p
          class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
        >
          AI Hype Indicators
        </p>

        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
        >
          Measuring public and corporate attention to AI.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-600">
          Price dynamics were complemented with indicators intended to capture
          changes in the broader level of attention surrounding artificial
          intelligence.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8"
        >
          <p
            class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400"
          >
            Public Attention
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
            Google Trends
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Search interest was used to represent shifts in public attention
            around artificial intelligence over time.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8"
        >
          <p
            class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-slate-400"
          >
            Corporate Attention
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
            SEC Filings
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
            AI-related terminology was extracted from 10-K and 10-Q filings
            available through SEC EDGAR to quantify changes in corporate
            discussion of AI.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- RESULTS -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >

      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">

        <div>
          <p
            class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
          >
            Key Findings
          </p>

          <h2
            class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
          >
            Speculative behavior was not uniform across AI-related sectors.
          </h2>
        </div>


        <div class="space-y-10">

          <article>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
              01
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Strong infrastructure outperformance after 2023
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              AI infrastructure companies exhibited particularly strong market
              performance during the post-2023 AI investment cycle.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
              02
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Explosive episode detected in infrastructure
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              GSADF analysis identified an explosive episode in the
              infrastructure portfolio around March 2024.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
              03
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Enterprise AI showed a later speculative episode
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              The enterprise portfolio exhibited a distinct explosive episode
              later in the sample, around May 2026.
            </p>

          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- RESULTS VISUALIZATION -->

<section
  class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
>

  <div class="max-w-3xl">

    <p
      class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
    >
      Results Visualization
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
    >
      Portfolio performance, AI hype and speculative dynamics.
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-600">
      The analysis combined relative portfolio performance with public and
      corporate AI-attention indicators, while the econometric methodology was
      validated against the dot-com episode.
    </p>

  </div>


  <!-- RELATIVE PERFORMANCE -->

  <figure class="mt-14">

    <div
      class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 sm:p-5"
    >
      <img
        src="/projects/ai-stocks/relative-performance.png"
        alt="Relative performance of AI thematic portfolios compared with QQQ"
        class="w-full"
      />
    </div>

    <figcaption
      class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500"
    >
      Relative performance of thematic AI portfolios against QQQ from 2018
      onward. AI infrastructure, particularly the core infrastructure
      portfolio, exhibits the strongest relative outperformance after 2023.
    </figcaption>

  </figure>


  <!-- HYPE INDICATORS -->

  <div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">

    <figure>

      <div
        class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3"
      >
        <img
          src="/projects/ai-stocks/public-hype-vs-performance.png"
          alt="Public AI hype index compared with AI portfolio relative performance"
          class="w-full"
        />
      </div>

      <figcaption
        class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500"
      >
        Public AI attention compared with relative AI-portfolio performance.
        Both measures rise substantially during the recent AI investment cycle,
        although their movements are not identical.
      </figcaption>

    </figure>


    <figure>

      <div
        class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3"
      >
        <img
          src="/projects/ai-stocks/corporate-hype-index.png"
          alt="Corporate AI hype index constructed from SEC filings"
          class="w-full"
        />
      </div>

      <figcaption
        class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500"
      >
        Corporate AI Hype Index constructed from AI-related terminology in SEC
        filings. Corporate discussion of AI increases markedly from 2023
        onward.
      </figcaption>

    </figure>

  </div>


  <!-- HISTORICAL VALIDATION -->

  <figure class="mt-16">

    <div
      class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 sm:p-5"
    >
      <img
        src="/projects/ai-stocks/dotcom-validation.png"
        alt="BSADF validation on the NASDAQ versus S&P 500 during the dot-com bubble"
        class="w-full"
      />
    </div>

    <figcaption
      class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500"
    >
      Historical validation using the NASDAQ Composite relative to the S&P 500.
      The BSADF statistic rises above the critical values around the dot-com
      bubble and peaks close to the March 2000 NASDAQ market peak.
    </figcaption>

  </figure>

</section>


    <!-- VALIDATION -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >

      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">

        <div>
          <p
            class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
          >
            Validation
          </p>

          <h2
            class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
          >
            Testing the methodology on the dot-com bubble.
          </h2>
        </div>


        <div class="space-y-6 leading-8 text-slate-600">

          <p>
            To verify that the econometric approach was capable of identifying
            historically recognized speculative behavior, the methodology was
            also applied to the 1998–2002 dot-com period.
          </p>

          <p>
            This historical benchmark provided a reference case for evaluating
            the behavior of the ADF and GSADF procedures before interpreting
            their results for modern AI-related equities.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- TECH STACK -->

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-24 lg:px-8"
    >

      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">

        <div>
          <p
            class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500"
          >
            Technology
          </p>

          <h2
            class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950"
          >
            Technical stack
          </h2>
        </div>


        <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">

          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Data Processing
            </p>

            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Python · Pandas · NumPy
            </p>
          </div>


          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Econometrics
            </p>

            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">
              statsmodels · ADF · GSADF · Time-Series Analysis
            </p>
          </div>


          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950">
